node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# audit-40: `**/dist` above matches engine/wasm-modules/dist — the CANONICAL, TRACKED location of
# pathfinding.wasm, which the sim server reads at startup. Stripping it from the build context left
# the container warning once on stdout and then serving a sim whose farmers could never move, under
# a process compose reported as healthy. Un-ignore the directory AND its contents: Docker skips the
# contents of an excluded directory, so the second line is not redundant.
!engine/wasm-modules/dist
!engine/wasm-modules/dist/**
.git
corpus
*.md
.env
infrastructure/.env
**/*.map
**/.turbo
